<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts coverage of 2 REITs.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts coverage of 2 REITs.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs &amp; Co analysts David Kostin and Richard Moore initiated coverage of two real estate investment trusts (REITs) on Monday, Goldman said.</p>
<p>-- Meditrust SBI, the largest U.S. health care REIT, was started with a market perform rating. Its shares were off 1/4 to 35 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- TriNet Corporate Realty Trust was started with a market outperform rating. Its shares were flat at 32 on Monday.</p>
</text>
